Quote style Variable expansion? Word splitting? Use for <code>"double quotes"</code> Yes No almost everything <code>'single quotes'</code> No (literal) No fixed text, no <code>$var</code> inside no quotes Yes Yes (dangerous) rarely — only literals with no spaces <pre><code>name="World"
echo "Hello, $name"     # Hello, World       (expands)
echo 'Hello, $name'     # Hello, $name        (literal, no expansion)
echo Hello, $name       # works here, but fragile — avoid the habit
</code></pre>
